{
  "surah": {
    "id": 80,
    "name_arabic": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
    "name_english": "Abasa",
    "name_english_translation": "He frowned",
    "verses_count": 42
  },
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse_number": 1,
      "text_arabic": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ",
      "text_english": "The Prophet frowned and turned away",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 2,
      "text_arabic": "أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ",
      "text_english": "Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting].",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 3,
      "text_arabic": "وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ",
      "text_english": "But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 4,
      "text_arabic": "أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ",
      "text_english": "Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 5,
      "text_arabic": "أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ",
      "text_english": "As for he who thinks himself without need,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 6,
      "text_arabic": "فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ",
      "text_english": "To him you give attention.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 7,
      "text_arabic": "وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ",
      "text_english": "And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 8,
      "text_arabic": "وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ",
      "text_english": "But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 9,
      "text_arabic": "وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ",
      "text_english": "While he fears [Allah],",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 10,
      "text_arabic": "فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ",
      "text_english": "From him you are distracted.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 11,
      "text_arabic": "كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ",
      "text_english": "No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder;",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 12,
      "text_arabic": "فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "So whoever wills may remember it.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 13,
      "text_arabic": "فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ",
      "text_english": "[It is recorded] in honored sheets,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 14,
      "text_arabic": "مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ",
      "text_english": "Exalted and purified,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 15,
      "text_arabic": "بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ",
      "text_english": "[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 16,
      "text_arabic": "كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ",
      "text_english": "Noble and dutiful.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 17,
      "text_arabic": "قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 18,
      "text_arabic": "مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "From what substance did He create him?",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 19,
      "text_arabic": "مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 20,
      "text_arabic": "ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "Then He eased the way for him;",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 21,
      "text_arabic": "ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 22,
      "text_arabic": "ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "Then when He wills, He will resurrect him.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 23,
      "text_arabic": "كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ",
      "text_english": "No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 24,
      "text_arabic": "فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ",
      "text_english": "Then let mankind look at his food -",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 25,
      "text_arabic": "أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا",
      "text_english": "How We poured down water in torrents,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 26,
      "text_arabic": "ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا",
      "text_english": "Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 27,
      "text_arabic": "فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا",
      "text_english": "And caused to grow within it grain",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 28,
      "text_arabic": "وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا",
      "text_english": "And grapes and herbage",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 29,
      "text_arabic": "وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا",
      "text_english": "And olive and palm trees",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 30,
      "text_arabic": "وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا",
      "text_english": "And gardens of dense shrubbery",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 31,
      "text_arabic": "وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا",
      "text_english": "And fruit and grass -",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 32,
      "text_arabic": "مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ",
      "text_english": "[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 33,
      "text_arabic": "فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ",
      "text_english": "But when there comes the Deafening Blast",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 34,
      "text_arabic": "يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ",
      "text_english": "On the Day a man will flee from his brother",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 35,
      "text_arabic": "وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ",
      "text_english": "And his mother and his father",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 36,
      "text_arabic": "وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ",
      "text_english": "And his wife and his children,",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 37,
      "text_arabic": "لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ",
      "text_english": "For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 38,
      "text_arabic": "وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ",
      "text_english": "[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 39,
      "text_arabic": "ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ",
      "text_english": "Laughing, rejoicing at good news.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 40,
      "text_arabic": "وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ",
      "text_english": "And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 41,
      "text_arabic": "تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ",
      "text_english": "Blackness will cover them.",
      "hadiths": []
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 42,
      "text_arabic": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ",
      "text_english": "Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones.",
      "hadiths": []
    }
  ]
}